TakeoutCleaner
===
A simple tool to extract the files generated via Google Takeout and then remove the subsequent metadata .json files that it provides.

Usage
---

powershell
.\TakeoutCleaner.ps1 -FolderPath $folderPath -ExtractFolder $extractFolder

$folderPath is the folder where the .zip files are located.

$extractFolder is the path where you want the files extracted to

Example:
---
powershell
.\TakeoutCleaner.ps1 -FolderPath "C:\GoogleTakeout\" -ExtractFolder "C:\GoogleTakeout\OutputPath"